# env/cloudflared.env: the token of the tunnel "bizinsights" (made with `cloudflared tunnel create`;
# `cloudflared tunnel token bizinsights` prints it). The tunnel has no public hostnames in Cloudflare's
# dashboard: TUNNEL_URL sends every name it receives to this project's web, and the zone's DNS records
# say which names those are (the apex and www, as tunnel records). A name pointed at this tunnel reaches
# this project, so a staging copy needs a tunnel of its own (staging.bizinsights.io was never made).
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
TUNNEL_URL=http://web:8080
